# Gishath, Sun's Avatar (7/6 trample, haste): "that many" is the combat damage dealt to the player, not Gishath's power. Turn 3: Bot2's
# Ornithopter (0/2) blocks the attacking Gishath; trampling over it Gishath assigns 2 to the blocker and 5 to Bot2 (20 -> 15), so Bot1
# reveals only 5 cards, not 7: the Imposing Vantasaur, Avian Changeling, two Islands and a Swamp (Prehistoric Pet was drawn for the
# turn). Bot1 takes just the Vantasaur; the other four go to the bottom, and the 12 cards left in the library keep their order, an Island on top.

